  <DocSection title="GM12878 ChromHMM track" lead={`A suggested track on hg19, drawn the way humanbase.io draws it: each segment from gm12878.ChromHMM.bb, ENCODE’s combined GM12878 segmentation with 25 state codes, as a box in the file’s own color. Shown with the file’s ${chromSegments.length} segments around the in silico mutagenesis example, ${view.format()}.`}>
