  <DocSection title="Item details" lead="Clicking an item in a track opens its details, as on humanbase.io: the Data tooltip, pinned, 280px wide, with the track’s name, the fields humanbase.io lists for that item and a close button. Shown with CELSR2 and the ReprW segment under the in silico mutagenesis example’s variant, from the recorded sample of the files, and the ASD Browser’s DNA disease impact score at PEX10, as the live file gives it.">
